# Flashcard QA

- When the user is **learning**, **reviewing concepts**, or wants **Q:/A:** flashcard-style output, follow the **Agent Skills** under `~/.cursor/skills/` named **`flashcard-qa-core`**, **`flashcard-qa-math-proofs`**, **`flashcard-qa-slash-commands`**, and **`flashcard-qa-json-export`**.
- **JSON export:** Read the export directory from **`~/.cursor/flashcard-qa/EXPORT_DIR`** (first non-empty line = absolute path). Create the directory if missing. Preserve **LaTeX** verbatim in JSON per **`flashcard-qa-json-export`**.
- **Shallow / quick fixes:** When the user only wants a trivial patch or one-off fix with nothing to memorize, skip flashcard formatting and JSON export per **`flashcard-qa-core`**.
